[thin] The 2.0 mm spring leaf and its R1.5 root flex in the print plane as the cover engages and releases.
alternatives: Derek tested thicker leaves that bent at their corners and a thinner version that he wanted stiffened. Changing thickness alters the return onto the 45° ledge.
